    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spirits of Baciu is an adventure puzzle game set in Hoia Baciu forest, one of the most mysterious and haunted places on the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will follow the adventures of The Lost One, a little spirit who suddenly wakes up in this dark forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How did he get here and what is haunting this place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719410/extras/20fe76936dbea153abe94a3f8c5101a1.poster.avif?t=1736767558\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719410/extras/20fe76936dbea153abe94a3f8c5101a1.webm?t=1736767558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719410/extras/20fe76936dbea153abe94a3f8c5101a1.mp4?t=1736767558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>If you have not already had the chance, you can play the Prologue for free, which is an introductory chapter already available that will not be playable in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compared to the Prologue, we improved the mechanics and graphics based</strong> on feedback received from players, we developed a <strong>new inventory system</strong> and added <strong>controller support</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719410/extras/1e43407c61ca53963bd38c9a33093801.poster.avif?t=1736767558\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719410/extras/1e43407c61ca53963bd38c9a33093801.webm?t=1736767558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719410/extras/1e43407c61ca53963bd38c9a33093801.mp4?t=1736767558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with your surroundings and solve numerous riddles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to spirits and collect clues and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine them to get new information</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the forest and the spirits that inhabit it... the only ones who can help you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719410/extras/c8f682c3ad49a0bc0b30322c78744f77.poster.avif?t=1736767558\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719410/extras/c8f682c3ad49a0bc0b30322c78744f77.webm?t=1736767558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719410/extras/c8f682c3ad49a0bc0b30322c78744f77.mp4?t=1736767558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New platform mechanics in addition to point-and-click mechanics, useful for solving specific puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn characters and frame-by-frame animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settings based on real photos combined with illustrated parts: observing the environment is very important for finding clues and collecting items in the inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talking to the forest dwellers will help you solve puzzles and find your way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original music with nostalgic vibes will give you a more immersive experience... you\u2019ll have to get lost to help The Lost One!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow us</strong> to stay updated! &lt;3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the upcoming Kickstarter campaign!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spirits of Baciu is an adventure puzzle game set in Hoia Baciu forest, one of the most mysterious and haunted places on the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will follow the adventures of The Lost One, a little spirit who suddenly wakes up in this dark forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How did he get here and what is haunting this place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719410/extras/20fe76936dbea153abe94a3f8c5101a1.poster.avif?t=1736767558\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719410/extras/20fe76936dbea153abe94a3f8c5101a1.webm?t=1736767558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719410/extras/20fe76936dbea153abe94a3f8c5101a1.mp4?t=1736767558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>If you have not already had the chance, you can play the Prologue for free, which is an introductory chapter already available that will not be playable in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compared to the Prologue, we improved the mechanics and graphics based</strong> on feedback received from players, we developed a <strong>new inventory system</strong> and added <strong>controller support</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719410/extras/1e43407c61ca53963bd38c9a33093801.poster.avif?t=1736767558\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719410/extras/1e43407c61ca53963bd38c9a33093801.webm?t=1736767558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719410/extras/1e43407c61ca53963bd38c9a33093801.mp4?t=1736767558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with your surroundings and solve numerous riddles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to spirits and collect clues and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine them to get new information</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the forest and the spirits that inhabit it... the only ones who can help you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719410/extras/c8f682c3ad49a0bc0b30322c78744f77.poster.avif?t=1736767558\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719410/extras/c8f682c3ad49a0bc0b30322c78744f77.webm?t=1736767558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719410/extras/c8f682c3ad49a0bc0b30322c78744f77.mp4?t=1736767558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New platform mechanics in addition to point-and-click mechanics, useful for solving specific puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn characters and frame-by-frame animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settings based on real photos combined with illustrated parts: observing the environment is very important for finding clues and collecting items in the inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talking to the forest dwellers will help you solve puzzles and find your way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original music with nostalgic vibes will give you a more immersive experience... you\u2019ll have to get lost to help The Lost One!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow us</strong> to stay updated! &lt;3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the upcoming Kickstarter campaign!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
